  "note": "In the book (4.38) is an assumption, checked for η₂ with ρ₀ = 4 in §6.2.1 via (6.2) and Lemma B.2.3 ((6.2) alone gives only |η̂_(ρ)''|∞ ≤ 48 log ρ). Lean proves it rather than assuming it, so Lean's Lemma 4.2.3 just requires D ≤ x/4 (ρ = x/m ≥ 4)."
